+// Supplemental P2P regression coverage for the AuxPow proof-of-work identifier
+// dispatch refactor in auxpow.go. These tests pin the externally observable
+// behavior that must survive the refactor: per-chain header construction and
+// byte layout, protobuf/JSON decode dispatch for every supported identifier,
+// unsupported-identifier outcomes, malformed/nil input handling, decode-path
+// ordering, per-chain hashing, and the frozen PowID spelling.
